- New tests: config + stdout must contain no `FlyV1`/`fm2_`; the returned token must list its own app's machines (200) and get rejected (401/403) on another app's.","timestamp":"2026-09-04T02:19:16.357Z"},{"id":"m1943","original_text_sha256":"6c684cb20e3bcec17d84941ca6116b0bf86c48ecf49f952e279b7aabb4303943","redacted":false,"role":"user","source_line":1943,"source_message_id":"c5a3a871-33e8-45d2-8c99-090b8dda4fe9","text":"there is only org token that i can create","timestamp":"2026-09-04T02:22:39.434Z"},{"id":"m1953","original_text_sha256":"9f19ca361cca965bec9e17e54b51c9be17659dcf301296004b46ebddbb725a32","redacted":false,"role":"assistant","source_line":1953,"source_message_id":"c72b7258-83e0-451e-a3b8-afab541b08f5","text":"Org token might work — create it, paste into `.env` as `FLY_API_TOKEN=`, tell me done, and I'll test whether it can mint scoped tokens.

